  questionText: "Eddie stole your gun and wanted me to return it. He says he never
    fired it, and he\u2019s sorry."
  largeQuestionBox: 1
  conversation:
  - ...
  - Yeah, I know it was him.
  - "Reason I didn\u2019t tell you, was because I wanted him to come clean himself.
    So I\u2019m actually kind of pissed that you grilled it out of him."
  - "That\u2019s stupid though. You\u2019re just doing your job."
  - Sorry.
  - ...
  - "I know he would\u2019ve come clean eventually, and I get why he did it, so it\u2019s
    fine."
  - "I\u2019m just glad he didn\u2019t do anything stupid, because I believe him
    when he says \u2018he never fired it\u2019."
  - "Because he knows I\u2019m not an idiot, and he knows that I would\u2019ve remembered
    how many bullets were in the mag."
  - 'Which of course begs the question:'
  - <color=notiCol><i>Why is a bullet missing?</i></color>
